/*
/// \file rijndael.cpp Implementation of the Rijndael cipher
//
// File : rijndael.cpp
// Creation date : Sun Nov 5 2000 03:22:10 CEST
// Author : Szymon Stefanek (stefanek@tin.it)
//
// Another implementation of the Rijndael cipher.
